synthetic-italic

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Slant the regular face by tan(15 degrees), as Ghostty does, when a font family has no italic face (FiraCode), so italic text reads as italic instead of upright.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: GPUI or Herdr synthesizes italics for families without an italic face.
